<title>USA: Norfolk, Neb., won by Chiles Heider.</title>
<headline>Norfolk, Neb., won by Chiles Heider.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiles Heider said it won $3.635 million of Norfolk, Neb., general obligation flood control bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.078 percent.</p>
</text>
